            <ArticleTitle>ICD nocardiosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>375-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present an initial report of Nocardia asteroides implantable cardioverter defibrillator infection. Systemic infection persisted despite pulse generator explant and several years of appropriate antibiotic therapy. Without epicardial lead system removal, chronic pleuropericardial disease developed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
